  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Garanti till Unicef</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee Unicef - Guarantee Unicef subsidy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Garanti till Unicef  f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra covid-19 respons samt f&#xf6;r Unicef att kunna uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla sin traditionella vaccins-verksamhet och st&#xf6;d till fattiga l&#xe4;nder avseende h&#xe4;lsa och h&#xe4;lsorelaterade produkter. Insatsen g&#xf6;rs i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation och MedAccess</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gurantee to Unicef  to enable a COVID 19 response and to uphold current vaccination programs and support poor countries access to health and health related products. The contribution is done in close partnership with Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation and Medaccess.</narrative>
  </description>
